self.KB_CONTENT["card:757882"]={"id":"card:757882","ty":"card","sourceId":"757882","title":"『退貨單建立作業』中的『品名 (TJ005)』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"品號","keywords":["品號","貨單","退貨","規格"],"y":"other","answer":"* 預設『品號資料建立作業』(INVI02)之資料，若品號設定可修改品名/規格，則本欄位可修改。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
