self.KB_CONTENT["card:782523"]={"id":"card:782523","ty":"card","sourceId":"782523","title":"『銀行帳號建立作業』中的『存款種類 (MA012)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"銀行","keywords":["銀行","帳號","存款"],"y":"other","answer":"* 設定該帳戶之存款種類。* 可依各銀行帳號種類分為1.活存、2.支存及3.其他三種存款種類。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:782624"]={"id":"card:782624","ty":"card","sourceId":"782624","title":"『BOM 變更單建立作業』中的『緊急 (TA004)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"變更單","keywords":["變更單"],"y":"other","answer":"* 預設為0，可接受 0-9 之數值，代表工程變更之緊急程度。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
